use this is not a career for me. I am just doing me.'\" This adds new factual content but does it materially advance OneGap? It establishes the feature in 2010s and its date (2016) but C4 already. It doesn't give month/album count. Maybe not. If OneGap is about date/month and albums, the quote is not directly relevant. So no.\n\nMaybe \"The article says Mtukudzi made a conscious decision to push back against musical invasion to preserve Shona and Ndebele traditional sounds, leading to birth of Tuku.\" Not relevant to OneGap. No.\n\nThus one finding.\n\nNeed ensure JSON only. Final with schema.\n\nLet's formulate statement precisely: \"According to the article, the '67 albums later' point was reached by the time Oliver Mtukudzi spoke to Forbes Africa in 2016.\" Evidence W3. Does this directly support? The sentence: \"67 albums later, Mtukudzi still spoke as if he was in search of what to call a career, telling Forbes Africa in 2016...\" Yes.\n\nCould also mention no exact month? No.\n\nI'll return."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1820,"completion_tokens":2577,"total_tokens":4397,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2527},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":0,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1820},"system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669"}